---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const locale = 'sw';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Mauzo na Uendeshaji wa Wateja — Nukuu, Ankara, CRM, Njia ya Mauzo"
  description="Nukuu, amri za mauzo, ankara, risiti za utoaji, mikopo, usimamizi wa wateja, njia ya mauzo, mfumo wa CRM, kamisheni za mawakala na usimamizi wa maeneo. Kraal Code ERP."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalUrl="https://kraalcode.com/sw/uwezo/mauzo/"
>
  <section class="page-hero section--warm"><div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Njia ya mkate"><ol><li><a href="/sw/">Nyumbani</a></li><li><a href="/sw/uwezo/">Uwezo</a></li><li aria-current="page">Mauzo na Uendeshaji wa Wateja</li></ol></nav>
    <h1>Mauzo na Uendeshaji wa Wateja</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-subtext">Kutoka nukuu ya kwanza hadi malipo ya mwisho. Faili moja la mteja, mfumo mmoja wa amri, rejista moja ya ankara — zimeunganishwa na hifadhi na uhasibu kwa wakati halisi.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Kwa nani moduli hii</h2>
    <p>Wakurugenzi wa mauzo, wawakala wa mauzo, wahudumu wa pesa na viongozi wanaohitaji mwonekano wa mzunguko mzima wa mauzo — kutoka nukuu hadi ukusanyaji.</p>
    <p>Kama biashara yako inatoa ankara, ina wateja wa rejareja, au inasimamia timu ya mauzo, moduli hii ndiyo inayoendesha mapato yako kutoka mwanzo hadi mwisho.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container">
    <h2>Unachoweza kufanya</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Nukuu na Amri</h3><p>Tengeneza nukuu, zigeuze kuwa amri za mauzo, tengeneza ankara. Fuatilia viwango vya ubadilishaji wa nukuu/amri. Utoaji wa sehemu na nyongeza zinasaidiwa.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Ankara za Wateja</h3><p>Ankara na hesabu za kodi, punguzo na sarafu nyingi. Chapisha au tuma kwa barua pepe. Fuatilia salio na hali ya malipo.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Risiti za Utoaji</h3><p>Thibitisha utoaji dhidi ya amri za mauzo. Hisa inapunguzwa kwa otomatiki wakati wa utoaji. Chapisha risiti za utoaji kwa usafirishaji.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Usimamizi wa Wateja</h3><p>Faili la mteja na mawasiliano, kikomo cha mkopo, masharti ya malipo na orodha za bei. Historia ya mteja, salio na kitabu cha mteja.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Njia ya Mauzo</h3><p>Kiolesura cha mguso kilichoboreshwa kwa rejareja na ukumbi wa chakula. Msimbo wa mwambaa, malipo ya pesa taslimu/mobile money/kadi. Vifaa vingi kwa kila tawi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>CRM ya Mauzo</h3><p>Mfumo wa wateja wanaoweza na fursa. Kumbukumbu ya mawasiliano. Utabiri wa mauzo. Ufuatiliaji wa ubadilishaji wa nukuu.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Usimamizi wa Mawakala</h3><p>Sajili mawakala wa mauzo. Panga maeneo na malengo. Fuatilia mauzo ya kila siku. Hesabu kamisheni (kiwango cha gorofa, cha hatua, kwa bidhaa).</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Usimamizi wa Maeneo</h3><p>Fafanua maeneo ya mauzo. Panga mawakala na wateja kwa maeneo. Fuatilia utendaji kwa eneo. Ripoti kwa eneo la kijiografia.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Jinsi moduli zinavyoungana</h2>
    <p>Moduli ya mauzo ndiyo chanzo cha mapato. Kila ankara inaathiri moduli nyingine:</p>
    <ul class="connection-list">
      <li><strong>Uhasibu</strong> → utambuzi wa mapato na maandishi ya deni za wateja unapotoa ankara</li>
      <li><strong>Hifadhi</strong> → hisa inapunguzwa kwa otomatiki unapotoa bidhaa</li>
      <li><strong>Miradi</strong> → ankara za mradi zinaweza kutengenezwa kutoka karatasi za saa na hatua</li>
      <li><strong>Manunuzi</strong> → mauzo ya juu yanaweza kusababisha amri za ununuzi kwa kuagiza tena</li>
    </ul>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Udhibiti na ruhusa</h2>
    <div class="controls-grid">
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Vikomo vya Mkopo</h3><p>Weka kikomo cha mkopo kwa kila mteja. Tahadhari za otomatiki unapokaribia au kuvuka kikomo.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Uidhinishaji wa Punguzo</h3><p>Punguzo zinazovuka kikomo zinahitaji uidhinishaji kutoka kwa msimamizi. Sanidi vikomo vya punguzo kwa watumiaji.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Njia ya Ukaguzi</h3><p>Kila ankara, nukuu na malipo yanarekodiwa: nani, lini, na thamani gani. Historia kamili ya mteja.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Kutenganisha Majukumu</h3><p>Ruhusa tofauti za kutengeneza nukuu, kuidhinisha amri, kutoa bidhaa na kukusanya malipo.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <h2>Ona kwa macho</h2>
    <p class="screenshot-intro">Picha kutoka mfumo halisi wa Kraal Code — inakuja hivi karibuni.</p>
    <div class="screenshot-grid">
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Nukuu na Amri</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Njia ya Mauzo</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">CRM ya Mauzo</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Dashibodi ya Mauzo</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section--dark section"><div class="container text-center">
    <h2>Ona mauzo kwa vitendo</h2><p>Oma onyesho lililobinafsishwa kwa shughuli za mauzo za shirika lako.</p>
    <a href="/sw/mawasiliano/" class="btn btn--inverse">Oma Onyesho →</a>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero{padding:var(--kc-space-20) 0 var(--kc-space-12)}.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-4xl);max-width:700px}.page-hero-subtext{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);max-width:60ch;margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.breadcrumb ol{list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;gap:var(--kc-space-2);font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.breadcrumb a{color:var(--kc-teal);text-decoration:none}.breadcrumb li:not(:last-child)::after{content:'/';margin-left:var(--kc-space-2);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.container--narrow{max-width:var(--kc-container-narrow)}.container--narrow p{font-size:var(--kc-text-base);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);line-height:var(--kc-leading-relaxed);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-4)}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-8)}.feature-card{padding:var(--kc-space-6);background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:1px solid var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg)}.feature-card h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-2)}.feature-card p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.connection-list{margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.connection-list li{margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-3);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.connection-list strong{color:var(--kc-text-primary)}.controls-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.control-item{padding:var(--kc-space-5);border-left:3px solid var(--kc-teal)}.control-item h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-base);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-1)}.control-item p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.screenshot-intro{color:var(--kc-text-secondary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.screenshot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6)}.screenshot-slot{aspect-ratio:16/10}.screenshot-placeholder{width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:2px dashed var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);gap:var(--kc-space-2)}.screenshot-label{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);color:var(--kc-text-primary)}.screenshot-note{font-size:var(--kc-text-xs);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.btn--inverse{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:var(--kc-space-4) var(--kc-space-8);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);background:transparent;color:var(--kc-text-inverse);border:2px solid var(--kc-teal-light);transition:all var(--kc-transition-fast);text-decoration:none;margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.btn--inverse:hover{background:var(--kc-teal);border-color:var(--kc-teal)}@media(max-width:768px){.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-3xl)}.feature-grid,.controls-grid,.screenshot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
